veltos-settings (1.1.0~dev3) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Mobile hotspot over the only Wi-Fi card: a second interface (veltos-ap,
    pkexec helper hotspot-interface) on cards that can be on a network and
    host one, on the channel of the card's own connection.
  * Personalization > Lock screen: the lock screen's own picture (wallpapers,
    the desktop's picture, Browse photos) with a preview.
  * Settings follows light/dark and the accent changed elsewhere (VeltOS AI,
    Quick Settings) at once.
  * Bottles chosen while offline: installed later by the sign-in set-up.

 -- VeltOS Developers <1ahmetfurkandemir@gmail.com>  Sat, 31 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0000

veltos-settings (1.1.0~dev2) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Accessibility > Mouse pointer: Windows 11's pointer styles (colour mode,
    white, black, custom colour) and size; the pointer follows light/dark mode.
  * The VeltOS network agent: Wi-Fi keys in a Windows 11 window, not KDE's dialog.
  * Windows programs open through GLib (gio launch), not kioclient.

 -- VeltOS Developers <1ahmetfurkandemir@gmail.com>  Sat, 31 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000

veltos-settings (1.1.0~dev1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Display: one scale for every arrangement; a dragged display stays inside.
  * Personalization > Keyboard lighting opens VeltOS Keyboard Lighting.
  * Location note: beaconDB by Wi-Fi, then the internet connection.
  * Apps > Windows programs: open them with VeltOS (Wine) or Bottles from Flathub.
  * Light/dark mode: the running taskbar is told the Plasma theme over D-Bus too.

 -- VeltOS Developers <1ahmetfurkandemir@gmail.com>  Tue, 27 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0000

